  "description": "The iceberg product contains two datasets describing iceberg concentration as number of icebergs counted within 10x10 km grid cells; one derived from Sentinel 1 IW mode and the other from Radarsat Constellation Mission data. The iceberg concentration is derived by applying a Constant False Alarm Rate (CFAR) algorithm on data from Synthetic Aperture Radar (SAR) satellite sensors.",
